  <!-- ===== objection FAQ ===== -->
  <section class="section on-mist">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:52rem">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="dim">Before you ask</p>
        <h2 class="h-1">Fair <span class="draft-u hl">questions</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>Will I keep up as a beginner?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Absolutely. Every exercise is adapted to your level, and your coach
            guides your technique in every session, so you&rsquo;ll keep up from day one.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>What if I&rsquo;m not free at fixed class times?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>There are over 100 sessions a week, from 6am to 9pm, seven days a
            week, so you can come to whichever three suit you each week.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>Is it really personal training if there are 5 people?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. You follow a programme written around your goals, and your
            coach gives you feedback and adjusts things for you all through the session, so you
            get the attention of personal training with the energy of a small group.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>What happens after the 30 days?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>You&rsquo;ll go through your results with your coach and choose the
            membership that suits you, with your next 12-week block planned the same way.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>How much is the Kickstart?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>It&rsquo;s {kickstartPriceLine()}, for the whole month, with everything
            included, no joining fee and no long contract at the end of it.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button type="button">
            <span>Does registering commit me to anything?</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>No. Registering saves your place, and one of the team will give you
            a ring to chat about your goals and get your first session booked in.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== motion kit 6 + register form ===== -->
  <section class="section on-dark" id="register">
    <div class="container grid-2" style="align-items:start">
      <div>
        <p class="annotation reveal">Five to a coach, so everyone gets looked after</p>
        <h2 class="h-1">Ready when <span class="draft-u">you are.</span></h2>
        <p class="lede">Pop your details in and one of the team will give you a ring for a
          friendly chat about your first 30 days.</p>
        <ul class="check-list" style="margin-top:1.4rem">
          {studios.map((st) => (
            <li>{st.name}, {st.addressLines[0]}, {st.postcode}</li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:1rem"><a href={url("contact/")} style="color:#5EA2FF">Or send us a message if you&rsquo;d like to talk first &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="align-self:start">
        <h3 class="h-3" style="margin:0 0 .6rem">Start your 30 days</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 1.5rem;color:#EAF1FB">All we need is your name, number and the
          studio that suits you, and one of the team will give you a ring.</p>
        <button type="button" data-enquiry-trigger
                class="btn btn-primary btn-big enquiry-trigger" style="width:100%">Get started</button>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-big enquiry-fallback" href="#enquiry" style="width:100%">Get started</a>
        <p class="small" style="margin:.9rem 0 0;text-align:center;color:#EAF1FB">Already decided?
          <a href={url("signup/")} style="color:#5EA2FF">Sign up now &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <EnquiryLightbox slot="body-end" client:load
    studios={studios.map((st) => ({ slug: st.slug, name: st.name, formValue: st.formValue }))}
    successHref={url("next-steps/")}
    successHrefByStudio={Object.fromEntries(studios.map((st) => [st.formValue, url(`${st.slug}/next-steps/`)]))}
    formId="website-enquiry-all-sites"
    heading="Start your 30 days"
    intro="Pick your studio"
    submitLabel="Book my friendly chat" />
</Base>
